     {
      "text": "I pulled the daily cost for Painting (dept_c) in August 2026, split by tariff band. The full result has 78 rows (one per day per band). Only the first 50 rows, covering 1\u201320 August, were shown to me. I can't quote figures for 20\u201331 August.\n\n**What the shown rows say (1\u201320 August):**\n- **Weekdays** have all three bands (F1, F2 and F3). **Saturdays** have only F2 and F3, and **Sundays** have only F3. That's why there are fewer than 93 rows.\n- **3\u20137 August cost much more** than the rest of the month. F1 alone was about \u20ac1,150\u20131,276 a day.\n- **From 10 August, weekday costs drop sharply**, to roughly \u20ac308\u2013312 in F1, \u20ac120\u2013123 in F2 and \u20ac159\u2013162 in F3. This could be the August holiday shutdown, but the data doesn't show the cause.\n- **Sundays** cost about \u20ac483\u2013486, all in F3.\n- **Saturdays:** 1 August cost about \u20ac714.55 in F2 and \u20ac190.23 in F3. On the later Saturdays (8 and 15 August), F2 was about \u20ac385\u2013387 and F3 about \u20ac160\u2013162.\n\nSome sample days:\n\n| Day | F1 (\u20ac) | F2 (\u20ac) | F3 (\u20ac) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Mon 3 Aug | 1,275.82 | 304.48 | 195.13 |\n| Sun 9 Aug | \u2013 | \u2013 | 484.86 |\n| Mon 10 Aug | 308.54 | 121.35 | 159.92 |\n| Sat 15 Aug | \u2013 | 386.73 | 160.42 |\n| Wed 19 Aug | 311.79 | 120.91 | 161.63 |\n\nThe cost is calculated from Painting's own department meter.",
